WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.635
Open Embed & Widgets

00:00:04.635 --> 00:00:06.060
Components the agent shows in conversation

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:10.641
Click New component to start from a template

00:00:10.641 --> 00:00:15.505
Shape it in the builder; the preview is live

00:00:15.505 --> 00:00:23.483
Or describe a change to the AI builder

00:00:23.483 --> 00:00:30.243
Name it and click Save

00:00:30.243 --> 00:00:31.745
Mention it in the prompt as @[[callback_request]]

00:00:31.745 --> 00:00:43.317
Style the widget under Appearance

00:00:43.317 --> 00:00:45.049
The preview updates as you change it

00:00:45.049 --> 00:00:49.541
Copy the snippet from Install & domains

00:00:49.541 --> 00:00:54.037
Flutter apps get their own setup

00:00:54.037 --> 00:01:01.654
Allow your site under Allowed clients
